{"title":"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf21d0acd344cb2319cafe78ed62914b014ea933.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{M}{45}=\\frac{60}{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5dd5a8bc23a54d7ef6deb0c1db3523c1ead488ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M+N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/b/c2bacd2e90af05a244fdb1afe31dccb264696315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 27\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 29 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 45 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 105\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 127$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Separate into two equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c5e73d4fe324c6bfc4369157633ef18e712911e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac35 = \\frac{M}{45}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e676402034181d21b69b8191307e75848f294dfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac35 = \\frac{60}{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" /> and solve for the unknowns. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/5/575ad8690ac6a2a8c7a1cc99164f8dcf20a85258.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=27$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/85710a1e86eb80e50393384531ce9c83f3f1dfbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/3/5d3e488ac3e810f4b29c3133f7967c9b7d1990be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M+N=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 127}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"154\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8\">2008 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">Prob